{"id":"532216678","kind":"article","title":"自稳态的睡眠倾向","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Homeostatic_sleep_propensity"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"睡眠研究 & 生活建议","date":"2022-06-22","updated":"2022-06-24","votes":21,"comment_count":5,"minutes":3,"chars":1435,"keywords":["自稳态睡眠倾向","睡眠","昼夜节律","认知疲劳","脑力工作","咖啡因"],"summary":"该术语条目介绍自稳态睡眠倾向（过程 S）：清醒时间和认知活动会累积睡眠压力，并与昼夜节律睡意共同影响睡眠及警觉性。作者依据睡眠双过程模型，建议把高强度脑力工作安排在睡眠压力较低的时段；同时指出咖啡因较晚使用可能干扰睡眠。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/532216678","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"pClQxJx4\"><b>自稳态的睡眠倾向</b>（又称<i>过程S</i>）是睡眠驱动力的一部分，由清醒时长决定。我们在清醒状态下持续活动的时间越长就会越困。我们学得越多，认知努力越高，睡眠倾向就会越高。良好的学习对睡眠是有益的。当昼夜节律和自然睡眠平衡的倾向联合起来时，睡眠就会出现。</p><p data-pid=\"y7KDd6u4\">自稳态睡眠与认知疲劳相关。认知疲劳会降低：警觉性、形成新记忆的能力、巩固记忆的能力以及创造力等等。</p><p data-pid=\"mqMYCLpF\">在醒着的一天中，我们沿着一条自稳态曲线从高度警觉到高度困倦逐渐移动。</p><p data-pid=\"20kavsQx\">另见：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"AqE8tNm4\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Two-process_model_of_sleep_regulation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">睡眠调节的双过程模型</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Tvf9-PU6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian_sleep_propensity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜睡眠倾向</a><br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"om9EcTIr\">本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">词汇表</a>条目用于解释《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Science_of_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">好睡眠、好学习、好生活</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>》(2017) 作者：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piotr_Wozniak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">彼得·沃兹尼亚克</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-4d96059b91de1a904aaccd044b35b2f0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4d96059b91de1a904aaccd044b35b2f0_r.jpg\" width=\"800\"/><figcaption>SuperMemo&amp;#39;s two-component sleep model inspired by the publications of Alexander A. Borbély and Peter Achermann.</figcaption></figure><blockquote data-pid=\"hazHNgTd\"> 图：对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Two-process_model_of_sleep_regulation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">睡眠调节的双过程模型</a>的示范性解释，取自 Windows 版 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a> 的实际睡眠记录。水蓝色线代表<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian_sleep_propensity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜睡眠</a>。绿线代表自稳态状态的警觉性（静止状态的睡眠倾向的逆向）。红线代表总体警觉性，是累积睡眠倾向的倒数。最佳警觉性是在睡眠倾向的两个组成部分都处于最低时实现的。受 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Alexander_Borbely\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Alexander A. Borbély</a> 和 Peter Achermann 的研究启发</blockquote><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ca6d586caf2b2f6c8f8708e70c2fe42a\" data-thumbnail=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ca6d586caf2b2f6c8f8708e70c2fe42a_b.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ca6d586caf2b2f6c8f8708e70c2fe42a_r.jpg\" width=\"800\"/><figcaption>Optimizing the timing of brainwork with respect to the circadian cycle.</figcaption></figure><blockquote data-pid=\"EIvOnPP6\"> 图：<b>优化与<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian_cycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜周期</a>相关的脑力劳动时间</b>。这张图是在 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SleepChart\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SleepChart</a> 的帮助下，根据长达 3 年每天对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Free-running_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自由运行的睡眠</a>结果的测量。横轴表示<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian_phase\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">从醒来开始的小时数</a>（注意，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Free-running_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自由运行的睡眠</a>周期可能长于 24 小时）。浅蓝色的点是实际的睡眠事件测量，横轴为时间，左纵轴为长度。<b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Homeostatic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自稳态</a></b>困倦度可以大致表示为<b>酝酿睡意的能力（主动睡眠）</b>。启动睡眠发作的百分比被画成一条粗蓝线（纵轴的右侧数值）。腺苷相关的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Homeostatic_sleep_propensity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">平衡睡眠倾向</a>与脑力劳动成比例增加，可以通过咖啡因、压力等部分清除。<b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜节律</a></b>睡意可大致表示为<b>维持睡眠的能力。主动睡眠的平均发生长度被画成一条粗红线（纵轴的左侧数值）。中午的警觉性低落也是昼夜节律，但在生物学上是不同的，导致睡眠时间短，不登记为红色峰值。</b>睡眠维持<b>的昼夜成分与以下因素相关：（1）与核心体温、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ACTH\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ACTH</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cortisol\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">皮质醇</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catecholamine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">儿茶酚胺</a>呈负相关，（2）与以下因素呈正相关。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Melatonin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">褪黑激素</a>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/REM_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">快速眼动睡眠</a> 倾向。最佳的脑力劳动时间</b>需要（1）低的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Homeostatic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自稳态</a>睡意，和（2）低的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜节律</a>睡意。在一天中，有两个高质量的警觉性区块：第一个是在醒来后，第二个是在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Siesta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">午睡</a>后。这两个区块都被标记为图表下面的黄色区间。为了获得最佳的学习效果，以及最佳的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Creativity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">创造力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>，请在这两个黄色区块的时间段安排学习。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Caffeine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">咖啡因</a>只能在最佳脑力劳动窗口的早期用于提高警觉性（棕色）。晚些时候使用会影响睡眠（咖啡因的半衰期约为 6 小时）。最佳运动时间未被标注，因为它可能根据 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Zeitgeber\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Zeitgeber</a> 的最佳时间而变化（例如，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/DSPS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DSPS</a> 人在清晨，ASPS 人在傍晚）。更多细节见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Biphasic_life\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">人类睡眠的双相性</a>。</blockquote><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"RJY0iByz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Homeostatic_sleep_propensity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Homeostatic sleep propensity - supermemo.guru</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 睡眠好，学习好，生活好 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/496134717\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/496134717</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 创造力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"450093869\" href=\"#/post/450093869\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"527695073","title":"谬误：我们会因为受寒而感冒","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":52,"minutes":4,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 睡眠研究 & 生活建议"},{"id":"547116585","title":"10 闹钟","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":64,"minutes":7,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 睡眠研究 & 生活建议"},{"id":"450093869","title":"创造力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":42,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"303204832","title":"彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":70,"minutes":9,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"602150910","title":"学习的乐趣","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":1152,"minutes":88,"reason":"延伸引用本文"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"721439557","title":"褪黑素：比你想知道的要多得多","author":"Scott Alexander","votes":146,"minutes":22,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「昼夜节律」· Scott Alexander"},{"id":"14141127318","title":"将教育与青少年的生物钟同步：「让青少年多睡会儿，推迟上学时间」","author":"Paul Kelley","votes":139,"minutes":28,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「昼夜节律」· Paul Kelley"},{"id":"1950516755240817475","title":"「早起鸟」在打压「夜猫子」吗？","author":"Robin Hanson","votes":81,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「昼夜节律」· Robin Hanson"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3095512261","title":"研究发现早晨课越多成绩越差，涉及到哪些医学知识？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1486,"minutes":14,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 1486 赞同","evidence":"回答正文中的原生链接锚点“自稳态的睡眠倾向”明确指向该译文；该证据支持标题/关键词提及。"},{"id":"2024783376297596199","title":"如何看待“学生和家长仅仅希望高中不要凌晨五点半就到校，多睡一个小时，就被指责为想搞快乐教育”这句话？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":804,"minutes":82,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 804 赞同","evidence":"逐对核验：回答用该译文的直接脚注锚点指向文章标题或对应的特定术语。"},{"id":"3333217724","title":"学习是一件反人类的事情吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":546,"minutes":90,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 546 赞同","evidence":"正文中有明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"},{"id":"3631852862","title":"手机真的会毁了孩子吗?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":495,"minutes":40,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 495 赞同","evidence":"摘录中的原生注释显示目标标题；正文“网络的压力”与目标主题不完全吻合，不能据此确认观点化用或正文摘录。"},{"id":"3265798117","title":"学习到底是快乐的，还是痛苦的?","author":"Thoughts Memo","vo